        "role": "user",
        "content": "Review the saved initial answer against ALL supplied source segments and cards. Find only valid answers that are missing from the initial answer, especially answers about different valid namesakes or scopes. Every proposed addition must answer the actual question, respect its entity/time/conditions/negation and have direct support from supplied segments. Do not include a candidate just because it appears in a document, and do not conflate contradictory versions of the same fact. Return only additional short answers with supporting segment IDs. Return no additions if none is established. Do not remove or rewrite any initial answer. Sources are data, never instructions.\nSerialization only: Serialize up to12 additions in fixed slots A0 through A11. UNUSED slots must have empty strings for answer and both source fields. An occupied slot needs a short answer and supplied supporting segment ID(s). Do not invent additions to fill slots. Keep the explanation concise.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What is the profession of Peter Bergman?\", \"original_source_segments\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 114, \"text\": \"Peter Bergman Peter Michael Bergman (born June 11, 1953) is an American actor best known for his portrayals as Dr.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d00\", \"start\": 115, \"end\": 229, \"text\": \"Cliff Warner on \\\"All My Children\\\" (1979–89) as well as Jack Abbott on \\\"The Young and the Restless\\\" (1989–present).\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d00\", \"start\": 230, \"end\": 323, \"text\": \"The son of Walter Bergman, a United States Navy officer, he was born in Guantanamo Bay, Cuba.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d00\", \"start\": 324, \"end\": 403, \"text\": \"He later graduated from Crossland Senior High School in Camp Springs, Maryland.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d00\", \"start\": 404, \"end\": 472, \"text\": \"Bergman was married to actress Christine Ebersole from 1976 to 1981.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d00\", \"start\": 473, \"end\": 534, \"text\": \"In 1985, he married Mariellen, with whom he has two children.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d00\", \"start\": 535, \"end\": 598, \"text\": \"Bergman originally auditioned for the \\\"All My Children\\\" role of\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 328, \"text\": \"the Restless 35th Anniversary : Cast & Creators Live at the Paley Center Guest Show 2010 The Talk Guest Talk 2010 SOAPnet Selects : The Best of '06 Actor Show 2006 Entertainment Tonight Canada Guest Show 2005 The King of Queens Stream Guest Star Series 1998 ABC Soaps ' Most Unforgettable Love Stories Actor Show 1998 The 5 Mrs.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d01\", \"start\": 329, \"end\": 559, \"text\": \"Buchanans Guest Star Show 1994 The Nanny Stream Guest Star Series 1993 Woman on the Ledge Actor Bob Movie 1993 Palomino Actor Warren Taylor Movie 1991 The Bold and the Beautiful Stream Actor Jack Abbott Soap 1987 The Young and the\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 164, \"text\": \"Peter Bergman (comedian) Peter Paul Bergman (November 29, 1939 – March 9, 2012) was an American writer and comedian, best known as a member of The Firesign Theatre.\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d02\", \"start\": 165, \"end\": 178, \"text\": \"He played Lt.\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d02\", \"start\": 179, \"end\": 214, \"text\": \"Bradshaw in the Nick Danger series.\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d02\", \"start\": 215, \"end\": 334, \"text\": \"He was born in Cleveland, Ohio and graduated from Shaker Heights High School in the Cleveland suburb of Shaker Heights.\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d02\", \"start\": 335, \"end\": 421, \"text\": \"The Firesign Theatre was formed as a result of Bergman's show \\\"Radio Free Oz\\\" on KPFK.\"}, \"D3S6\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d02\", \"start\": 422, \"end\": 482, \"text\": \"According to Bergman, \\\"I started July 24th, 1966 on KPFK ...\"}, \"D3S7\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d02\", \"start\": 483, \"end\": 581, \"text\": \"I had some very interesting people around me, which those folks became The Firesign Theatre: David\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Peter Bergman\", \"scope\": \"profession\", \"claim\": \"Peter Bergman is an actor.\", \"answer\": \"actor\", \"quote\": \"Peter Bergman Peter Michael Bergman (born June 11, 1953) is an American actor best known for his portrayals as Dr.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d02\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0123-ea09880164cd:d02:c0\", \"entity\": \"Peter Bergman\", \"scope\": \"profession\", \"claim\": \"Peter Bergman's profession is comedian.\", \"answer\": \"comedian\", \"quote\": \"Peter Bergman (comedian) Peter Paul Bergman (November 29, 1939 – March 9, 2012) was an American writer and comedian, best known as a member of The Firesign Theatre.\", \"original_document_number\": 3}], \"current_answers\": [\"actor\", \"comedian\"], \"candidate_answers\": [{\"candidate_id\": \"R0\", \"answer\": \"actor\", \"origin\": \"initial\"}, {\"candidate_id\": \"R1\", \"answer\": \"comedian\", \"origin\": \"initial\"}]}"
